<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="HOS" style="id">Hosea</book>
  <para style="h">Hosea</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hosea</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hosea</para>
  <para style="mt">Hosea</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judai rama Uzia te, Jothama te, Ahaza te, Hezekia te lal lai leh Israel rama Joasa fapa Jeroboama a lal laiin, Beria fapa Hosea hnênah Lalpa thu a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hosea hnêna Lalpan thu a sawi tirhin heti hian a rawn ti a: “Kal la, uire hmang thlah zînga mi nupuiah va nei rawh; ani chuan amah ang bawk fa a hrinsak ang che. Ram chuan uire a chîng a, Lalpa chu a uiresan ta a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, a kal a, Diblaima fanu, Gomeri chu nupuiah a va nei a. Ani chuan nau a pai a, fapa a hrinsak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a hnênah, “A hmingah Jezreela sa rawh. Jezreel hmuna Jehuan thisen a chhuah chiam phuba chu rei lo teah a thlahte chungah ka la dâwn. Israel-ho lalna chu ka titâwp ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan Israel thalngul chu Jezreel ruamah ka titliak ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gomeri chuan nau a pai leh a, fanu a hring a. Hosea hnênah, “A hmingah Lainatlohvi sa rawh. Israel chhûngte chu ka lainat tawh dâwn lo, ka ngaidam tawh ngai lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Juda chhûngte erawh chu ka lainat ang a, kei Lalpa , an Pathian ngei hian ka chhan chhuak ang; thal te, khandaih te, indona te, sakawr chungchuang mi te chakna hmang lovin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lainatlohvin hnute a nghei hnuah Gomeri chuan nau a pai leh a, fapa a hring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hosea hnênah, “A hmingah Kaminilova sa rawh, ka mi in ni tawh lo va, kei in Pathian ka ni tawh si lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Israel fate chu tuifinriat ṭiauvaivut anga tam, chhiar sên rual loh an la ni leh ang. Anni chu, ‘Ka mi in ni lo,’ lo ti tawh mah ila ‘Pathian nung fate in ni,’ ka la ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, Juda-te leh Israel-te chu an inzawm leh ang a, hruaitu pakhat an nei ang a, an ramah chuan an hmuingîl hle ang. Pathianin a dinthar ni chu ropui tak a ni dâwn si a.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />In unaupate chu, ‘Pathian mi in ni,’ ti ula, in farnute pawh ‘Pathian lainat in ni,’ ti ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ṭan suh u, in nu hi ṭan tawh suh u, Ka nupui a ni tawh lo va, A pasal ka ni tawh hek lo. A uire mit men hi bânsan sela, A inpho îtawm hi sim rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A duh loh chuan a silhfên ka hlihsak vek ang a, A pian ni ang maia saruakin ka awmtîr ang. Thlalêr ram ro tak angin ka siam ang a, Tuihâl dang chârin a thi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A fate pawh ka lainat lo vang, Uire fa an ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Anmahni paitu, an nu chu a zahpuiawm hle mai, Ngaihzâwng a nei a, ‘Chaw te, tui te, sahmul te, puan te, hriak te, In tûr te min petu, ka ngaihzâwng ka pan dâwn,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuvângin, a kawng hlîngin ka hnawh ang a, Amah dâl nân bang ka siam ang. Tichuan, a kawng a hloh tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A ngaihzâwngte a ûm ang a, a ûm pha chuang lo vang, Anni chu a zawng ang a, a hmu hek lo vang. ‘Ka pasal hnênah ka kîr leh teh ang. Tûn ai hian ka chan a ṭha zâwk si a,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chaw te, uain te, oliv hriak te petu Ka nih a hre si lo. Baal hnêna a hlan rangkachak leh tangkarua pawh ka pêk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A seng hunah ka buh leh uain ka lâksak ang a, A saruak khuhna tûra ka pêk sahmul leh la ka lâksak bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A ngaihzâwngte hmaah saruakin ka awmtîr ang a, Ka kut ata tu man an chhan chhuak lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An hlimna hun, an kum tin kûtpui te, Thla thar kût te, sabat ni te, khâwmpui tinrêng te nên ka titâwp ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Grep leh theipui kûng, a ngaihzâwng hnêna a hlawh, ‘Min pêk,’ a tih ṭhin chu ka tichhe vek ang, Ramhnuaiah ka chantîr ang a, ramsaten an tlân ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bengbeh leh ṭhite awrhin a inchei mawi a, A ngaihzâwngte a chhai ṭhîn. Baal hnênah inthawina a hlân fo, Kei mi theihnghilh avângin ka hrem a ni,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Mahse, ani chu zaidam takin ka thlêm ang a, Thlalêrah ka hruai ang a, Tah chuan biahthu ka lo hlân ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A grep huante ka pe kîr leh ang a, Akor ruam chu beiseina kawngkaah ka siamsak ang, Aigupta ram ata a lo chhuah lai, A tleirâwl lai nite ang khân, Lâwm takin min lo chhâwn ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa thuchhuak chuan heti hian a ti: “ ‘Baal’ min ti tawh lo vang a, ‘Kan pa’ min ti zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Baal hming a lam ṭhin chu ka titâwp ang a, chu hming chu a lam leh tawh ngai lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan ramsa te, chunglêng sava te, Leia bawkvâka kalte chu thu ka thlunpui ang a, Ram ata thal te, khandaih te, indona te ka tibo vang a, Thlamuang takin an awm tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kumkhua atân nupuiah ka nei ang che a, Ka ta ni tûrin ka hual che a ni. Dik tak leh rinawm taka awmin, Hmangaihin ka lainat ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka pawm kumkhua ang che, Ka tân ka hual tlat tawh che hi, Tichuan, Lalpa ka nih i hre chiang ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpa thuchhuak chuan heti hian a ti: “Chumi ni chuan vân ata ruah ka sûrtîr ang a, Leiin a ṭhatpui ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lei aṭangin buh te, grep te, Oliv te, A ṭo vang a, a duah hluah hluah ang. Jezreel ruam pawh a vul leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />He ramah hian ka pual atân ka din nghet ang a, Lainatlohvi chu ka lainat ang a, Kaminilova chu ‘ka mi i ni,’ ka ti ang a, Annin, ‘Ka Pathian i ni,’ min ti ang.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah, “Kal leh ta la, i nupui duh lai, uirenu chu va rîm leh rawh, Israel-te chuan pathian dang hnêna grep ro chhang hlân uar hle mah se, Lalpa chuan a la hmangaih tho ang hian,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, a manah tangka tlang sâwm leh panga leh barli ṭîn sâwm ka pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Rei fe chhûng chu ka inah awmin invawng thianghlim la, nawhchi zuar lo la, tlangvâl pawh nei suh; chutiang bawkin kei pawh ka invawng thianghlim ang,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel fate pawh hun rei fe chu lal leh hotu te, inthawina leh hmun serh te, aienna milimte nei lovin an awm dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan Israel fate chu an lo hawi kîr ang a, an Pathian, Lalpa leh Davida chu an rawn pan ang; Lalpa chu an ṭih ang a, a zâr an zo kumkhua tawh ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel fate u, Lalpa thu hi hre rawh u. He ramah hian rinawmna te, khawngaihna te, Pathian hriatna te a awm loh avângin Lalpa chuan a chhûnga chêngte a thiam lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thu an tiam a, an zâwm lo va, Tual an that a, rûk an ru a, An uire a, serh leh sâng rêng an nei lo, Inzawm zatin tual an that.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ram chuan a tuar ang a, A chhûnga awm zawng zawng an chau vang, Tuipui sangha chenin an boral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tu mah inhêkin tu mah lo indem suh u, Nangni puithiamte hi a ni ka demte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A chhûn a zânin in tlu in tlu a, Zâwlneite pawh nangmah ang chauh an ni, I nu, Israel chu, ka tiboral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka miten min hriat duh loh avângin an boral a, Nang pawhin min hriat duh loh avângin Ka puithiam ata ka bân che hi, I Pathian dânte i thlahthlam a, Kei pawhin i fate ka thlahthlam ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An tam poh leh ka laka sual an tam a, An ropuina chu an mualphonaah ka chantîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka mite sualna chu chênin an inei thau va, Sual zêl se an ti êm êm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An awm dân leh an thiltih avângin ka hrem ang, Mipui leh puithiamten angkhatin an tuar ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Inthawina sa an ei ṭeuh ṭeuh va, An kham si lo, Chi ṭhatna pathian an pan a, fa an ngah chuang lo, Lalpa chu an hawisan avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hurna te, uain te, zu te hian Thinlung a hruai bo ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka miten an thing serh an râwn a, An tiangin inlârna an zawng a, Milem biak an châkna chuan a hruai bo va, An Pathian chu uiresanin an hawisan ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tlâng chhîpahte an inthawi a, Tlâng pangahte rimtui an hâl, Sasua te, beraw te, hriang thingbuk hnuaiah te, In fanute an inphalrai a, In mote pawh an uire ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An sualna leh uirena avângin In fanute leh in mote chu ka hrem lo vang. Nangni ngei hi nawhchizuar tawmpuitu, Milem hnêna inthawina eitu in ni a, Chinchâng hre lote chu tluchhe âwm rêng an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aw Israel, nang chu uire mah la, Juda zawng uire ve lul suh se, Gilgal-ah te, Beth-aven-ah te inthawi tûrin chho suh u, Tah chuan Lalpa hming chhâlin chhia chham hek suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel zawng, bâwngla anga luhlul a ni, Phûla berâm tla angin Engtin nge Lalpan a vên theih ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Efraim chuan milem a be ta a, An duh ang ang chuan awm teh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zu hmunah nuam an chên a, suahsual an bâwl zui a, Ngaihsân nih aiin mualpho an thlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thlipuiin a la bo vang a, An inthawinate avângin an la zak ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Puithiamte u, hei hi hre rawh u, Israel mite u, ngaihtuah teh u, Dik taka rorêl tûr in ni a, Mahse, Mizpa-ah thang in kam a, Tabor tlâng thlengin lên in zâr hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hel hmangho chu tualthahnaah an inrawlh thûk êm a, Ka hrem vek dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Efraim chu ka hre chiang a, Israel chu ka lakah thuhrûk a ni lo. Tûnah hian Efraim chu a uire tâk avângin Israel chu a bawlhhlawh zo ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An thiltihte chuan Pathian hnêna an kîr lehna a dâl tlat a. Uire rilru an put hlawm avângin Lalpa chu an hre thei lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A chapo avângin Israel chu a mualpho va, A sual avângin Efraim pawh a tlu ang a, An zîngah Juda pawh a tlu ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An berâm leh bâwng rualte hlânin Lalpa zawngin inthawi mah se, An hmu lo vang, Anni chu a hawisan tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa lakah vervêk takin thil an ti a, An fate pawh falak an ni, An ram nên lam an chhe thuai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gibe-ah berâmpa ki hâm ula, Rama khuaah tawtawrâwt hâm rawh u, Beth-aven-ah râlkhêl dâr vua ula, ‘Benjamin, an ûm pha dâwn che,’ ti rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Efraim chu zilh a nih hunah a chhe vek ang, Israel-te chunga chhiatna thleng ngei tûr chu ka puang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Juda hruaitute chu ramri lung sawntu ang an ni, Ka thinur chu tui angin an chungah ka leihbua ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Efraim chu rahbehin a awm ta, Milem a be lui tlat si a. A chungthu chhe taka rêlsak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuvângin, kei hi Efraim tingêttu ka ni a, Juda chhûngte tiṭawihtu pawh ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Efraim chuan a natzia a inhria a, Juda pawhin a hliam natzia a hria, Ṭanpui dîlin Efraim a kal Asuria hnênah, An na leh hliam tidam thei lo lal ropui chu an bêl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Efraim tân sakeibaknei ang ka ni ang, Juda chhûngte tân pawh sakeibaknei vânglai ang ka ni. Keimah ngeiin ka pawt sawm ang a, ka pu bo vang, Ka hnûk chhuak ang a, tu man an chhan thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An sual sima ka lam an hawi hma chu Ka awm bosan daih ang a, An hrehawm tuar avâng chuan Ṭhahnemngai takin min la zawng dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hawh u, Lalpa hnênah i kîr ang u, Min vaw na hle nâ a, Min tuam dam leh dâwn si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ni hnih hnuah min tiharh leh ang a, Ni thum ni chuan min tinung leh ang a, Tichuan, a hmaah kan awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hriat i tum ang u, Lalpa chu hriat i tum tlat ang u, Lei ro tihnâwng tûra ṭhâl ruah sûr ṭhîn ang hian, Zîng anga khêl lovin Lalpa chu Min tiharh tûrin a lo kal ngei dâwn e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw Efraim, engtin nge ka tih ang che, Aw Juda, engtin nge ka tih tâk ang che? Min hmangaihna chu zîng chhûm ang leh Dai tla ral ta mai ang hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuvângin, zâwlneite hmangin ka tidarh che a, Ka thu-a thah in ni, In chunga ka rorêl hi êng anga chiang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Inthawina aiin khawngaihna a ni ka duh, Hâlral thilhlan aiin Pathian hriatna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Anni chuan Adama angin thuthlung an bawhchhia a, Tichuan, zahpuiawm takin an khawsa ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gilead chu mi sualte hmunpui a ni a, Thisen a luang zuih mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Suamhmang rualin mi an lambun ang hian, Puithiamte chuan inthawi tuma Sekem pante an châng a, An lo that ṭhîn a, a va râpthlâk êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel chhûngkaw zîngah thil râpthlâk tak ka hmu. Efraim chu a uire a, Israel chu a intibawrhbâng zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka mite chanvo ka tundin leh hun chuan Nang pawh, Juda, rah seng tûr i nei ve ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel-te tihdam ka tum apiangin Efraim bawhchhiatna ka hmu chiang a, Samaria sualnate nên, An inbum a, mi an rawk a, Kawtthlêrah mi an suam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An sualnate ka hre reng tih an ngaihtuah lo, An thil sual tihin an inhaivûr a, ka hmu reng si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lal tihlâwm nân thil sual an ti a, Rorêltute tihlâwm nân dâwt an sawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chhang urtuin a chhang ur nân tuah belh ngai lo khawpa A thuk a tihsat ang hian, thil sual tih an châk ut ut a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lal an chawimawi ni chuan miliante an rui buai a, Lal pawh a rui mualpho hle.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi an phiar a, an thin chu thuk angin a sa a, Meivâpin meiling zâna a khuh, Zînga a lo alh ta hluah ang hi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An thinur chu thuk ang an ni, An hruaitute pawh an that a, An lalte pawh an râwt a, Tu man mi lam duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Efraim chu hnam dangte nên an inpawlh ta, Chhang lehlam chauh ur hmin ang hi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hnam dang an rinchhan a, an chak loh phah a, Chu chu an hrethiam si lo. An lu ṭuak tawh hle pawh chu an hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel-te chu an chaponain a tihmêlhem a, An Pathian, Lalpa hnênah an kîr duh lo va, A lam hawi duh tu mah an awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Efraim chu ngaihtuahna nei lo ṭhûro ang hi a ni, A chângin Aigupta a au va, a chângin Asuria a pan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A kalna apiangah lênin ka khuh ang a, Chunglêng sava angin ka man khâwm ang. An thiltih sual avângin ka hrem dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Min hawisantute chu an chung a pik e, Ka laka an hel avângin chhiatnain tlâkbuak rawh se. Anni chu chhandam ka duh a, a derin min be si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An thinlung chhûngril takin min au lo va. Milem biate angin khum laizâwlah an chiau an chiau va, Zu leh chaw dîlin an inzai thi zawih zawih a, Ka lakah an va hel nasa teh rêng êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keimah ngeiin anni chu ka zirtîr a, ka thuam a, Anni erawh chuan min phiar a, min do lêt ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chung lam an hawi duh lo, Thalngul rul tawh, hman tlâk loh ang an ni. An hruaitute an ṭawng chaltlai êm avângin khandaiha thah an ni. Aigupta miten an va nuihzat dâwn êm!
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka miten ka thuthlung an bawhchhia a, Ka dân an zawm loh avângin Mupui bir angin hmêlmate an lo thawk e, Râlkhêl tawtawrâwt hâm rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />‘Aw Pathian, keini Israel chuan kan hria che asin,’ Tiin min au ṭhîn nâ a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel-te chuan thil ṭha an hnâwl a, Hmêlmate chuan an ûm dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka rem tih lohvin lalte an thlang a, Ka hriatpui lohvin hruaitute an ruat bawk a, An tangkarua leh rangkachaka siam milemte chu An chhiat phah dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Samari mite u, in bâwngno lim biak chuan Min va ngei tak êm! In chungah ka thinur êm êm a ni, Engtikah tak milem biak hi bânsan ang maw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel themthiamte siam milim chu Pathian a ni lo ve. A ni, Samari khuaa an biak bâwngno lem pawh Tihkehsawm vek a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thlifîm a tleh a, thlipuiin a nuai dâwn a ni, An thlai chîn chu a vui lo vang a, a rah hek lo vang, Rah mah se, hnam dangte ei tûr mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel chu hnam dangin an chîm ral ta, Bungbêl hman tlâk loh ang mai an nih tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ram sabengtung luhlul ang maiin, Asuria bêl tûrin a chhoh tâk saw. Efraim chu a ngaihzâwngte hnênah a inhralh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hnam dang zîngah inhralh mah se, Anni chu ka vai khâwm ang a, An belh lal ropui tihduhdah tuarin An kun tlawk tlawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Efraim chuan bawhchhiatna hmun atân Maichâm a din belh zêl a, Chûng maichâm chu suahsual an bâwlna hmun a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka dânte ziaksak ṭeuh mah ila, Mi dang tân leka ngaiin an hnâwl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Inthawina hlan te, a sa eite an lâwm a, Mahse, Lalpa lâwmzâwng a ni si lo, An bawhchhiatnate a hre reng a, an sual avângin a hrem ang a, Aigupta ramah a kîrtîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel chuan anmahni siamtu an theihnghilh a, Lal in ropui tak an sa a, Juda chuan khawpui kulh nei a din belh zêl a, Mahse, chûng khawpuite chu ka hâl ang a, An in ropuite chu a kâng fai vek ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Israel-te u, hnam dangte kût hmangin Hlim ve bûng bûng suh u, Chu chu in Pathian laka uirena a ni. Hruihzâwl tina i nawhchizawrh hlawh chu i thlahlel a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hruihah leh grep khurah chuan Kham khawp i hmu lo vang, Uain thar tûr a awm hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa ramah an chêng reng lo vang, Efraim chu Aigupta ramah a chhuktîr ang a, Ṭhenkhat chuan Asuria ramah ei thiang lo an ei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa hnênah uain an hlân lo vang a, An inthawinate chuan a tilâwm hek lo vang. Lusûnte ei ṭhin ang chaw an ei ang a, a ei apiang an bawlhhlawh ang. An chaw chu anmahni pumpuarna mai a ni ang a, Lalpa hnên a thleng lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa puala khâwmpui urhsûn a lo thlen ni chuan, Eng nge in tih tâk ang le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chhiatna lo thleng tlânsantute chu, Aigupta-ah an tlân khâwm ang a, Memfis hmunah phûm an ni ang. An tangka ro hlûte kangṭhaiin a bâwm ang a, An chênna inahte pawh hnimhlîngnei a khat ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hremna ni chu a lo thleng ta, Sual man hmuhna ni chu. Israel-te u, hre teh u, In sual êm avâng leh in luhlul êm avâng zâwkin Zâwlnei chu, ‘mi â’ in ti a, Thlarau mi chu, ‘Mi â bawraw,’ in ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zâwlnei chu, ka Pathian mi, Efraim-ho vêngtu a ni a, A kalna apiangah thang an lo kam a, A Pathian inah pawh an dodâl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gibea khuaa suahsualna ang khân an sualna chu a râpthlâk a, Pathianin an bawhchhiatnate a hre reng si a, An sualna avâng chuan a hrem ngei dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel chu thlalêrah khân grep angin ka hmu a, In pate pawh theipui hmin hmasa angin. Nimahsela, Peor tlânga Baal chu an pan a, An ngaihzâwng pathian tenawm tak ang chuan Zahpuiawm takin an awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Efraim ropuina chu sava angin a thlâwk bo ta, Nau hring te, nau pai te an awm tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An fate awmtlei mah se, An vaiin an sûn vek ang a. Anni chu ka kalsan hun chuan, An chan a va chau dâwn tak êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Efraim chu Tura angin ram ṭha taka a awm ka hmu a, Mahse, Efraim chuan thah atân mai fa a ngah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , an tân eng nge i tihsak ang? Nau chhiattîr la, an hnutetui tikang ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Gilgal-ah an sualna a hluar ṭan a, Tah chuan a ni ka huat tâk ni. An thil sual tihte avângin ka hmangaih tawh lo vang. An hruaitu zawng zawngin min helsan ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Efraim chuan chhiat a tâwk ta, A zung chenin a ro zo va, Rah a chhuah thei ta lo. Nau pawh hring se, an duh lai, An rîla rah chu ka tihlum ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A thu an awih loh avângin Ka Pathian chuan anni chu a hnawt darh ang a, Hnam dang zîngah an vâkvai ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel chu grep duah tak Rah tiar tuar ang hi a ni ṭhîn a, A rah tam poh leh maichâm a siam tam a, A hausak poh leh an biak lungphun a cheimawi mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An thinlung chu bumnain a khat a, An sual man chu an hmu ngei ang. An maichâm ka tichim ang a, An biak lungphunte pawh ka tichhe vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />‘ Lalpa kan ṭih lo va, lal kan nei ta lo va ni, Nei pawh ni ila, Kan tân eng nge sâwt ang?’ an la ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An ṭawng mai mai a, Dâwtin chhia an chham a, thute an thlung a, Lei rih thlûra hlo har a khat tlat ang hian Dikna an dîp raltîr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Samari khawpuia chêngte chu, Beth-aven bâwngno lim avâng chuan Hlauvin an khûr ang a, A ropuina tihchhiat a nih avângin Mite chu an ṭap ang a, A puithiamte chu an chiau vawng vawng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Asuria lal ropui tak pêk tûrin Berâmno lim chu an kalpui ang a, Efraim chu a mualpho let dêr ang; A remruat avângin Israel chu a zak hle ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuiin hnâwl a lên ang hian, Samari lal pawh an hruai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel-te suahsual bâwlna Aven hmunsângte chu tihchim a ni ang. A maichâmah hlîng leh hnimhlîngnei a ṭo chûk ang a, Mite chuan tlâng hnênah, ‘Min khuh rawh,’ an ti ang a, Mual hnênah, ‘Min delh rawh,’ an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Israel, Gibea khuaa thil sual in tih ang kha, In la ti zui ta zêl a, Gibea khuaah indonain a nangchîng ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hêng mi sualte hi ka bei ang a, Ka hrem ang. Anmahni bei tûrin hnam dang an ṭangrual ang a, An sualna avângin hrem an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Efraim chu buh chîl peih tak bâwngla hmin tawh angin, A nghâwng mawiah nghâwngkawl ka bât ang a, Efraim chuan lei a rît ang a, Juda chuan lei a let ang a, Jakoba chuan leitlang a tidip ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />In leiletah dikna theh ula, Khawngaihna in seng dâwn nia; In ram khêk chu let ula, Lalpa chu zawn hun a ni, A lo kal ang a, mal a sâwm ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sualna in theh a, in khawloh zawh tâk hi. Mahni inbum in ni. Mahni chaknaah in innghat a, In sipai ngah in chhuang vei si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuvângin, indopuiin in mite a nang ang a, In kulh zawng zawng a chhe vek ang. An inbeiha Beth-arbel khua Lal Salmanan a sawisa ang khân, Nunau lamin thah in ni ve ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nangni Bethel-a awmte u, in sual êm avângin Chûng thilte chu in chungah a lo thleng dâwn, Zînga inbeihna an ṭan veleh Israel lal chu a thi nghâl ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israela chu a naupan lai aṭangin ka hmangaih a, Ka fa atân Aigupta ata ka ko chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka koh zin poh leh min hlat sauh zêl a, Baal hnênah an inthawi a, Milem hnênah rimtui an hlân hlauh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Efraim chu keimah ngeiin kal ka zirtîr a, A bânah ka kai ṭhîn. Nimahsela, ka awmtlei an ni tih an hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khawngaih leh lainat takin Anni chu ka hruai dial dial a, An phurritte ka chhâwk a, Duat takin ka châwm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuti chung pawhin mi bêl duh lo va, Aigupta-ah an kîr leh ang a, Asuria-in a awp bawk ang, Anmahni remruat chauh an zawm avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An khawpuiah khandaih a lêng ang a, An kulh kawngkhârte chu a chhe vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka mite chuan min hawisan tlat a, An nghâwngkawl rih avângin. Chungnungbera an au vang a, Mahse, tu man an hlihsak lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Efraim, engtin nge ka bânsan theih ang che? Adma angin engtin nge ka tihchhiat theih ang che? Zeboim angin engtin nge ka sawisak theih ang che, Ka lungrilah i châm tlat a, Ka hmangaih zual deuh deuh che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka thinrim nasa tak chu ka hrithla lo vang a, Efraim chu ka tichhe leh tawh lo vang. Pathian ka nih hi, mihring ka ni lo ve, In zînga chêng, Mi Thianghlima chu thinrimin ka lo kal tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa chu sakeibaknei angin a rûm ang a, Tichuan, anni chuan an zui ang, Ring takin a au vang a, Khawthlang lam aṭangin a fate an lo haw hlawk hlawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aigupta ram aṭangin sava thlâwk anga chakin an lo chho vang a, Asuria ram ata ṭhuro angin an lo chhuk bawk ang. Tichuan, an ramah ngei ka chêntîr leh ang, Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Efraim chuan dâwt min hrilh kual min hrilh kual a, Israel-te chuan bum an hrât êm êm a, Juda pawhin Pathian, Mi Thianghlima leh Rinawma chu A dodâl reng a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Efraim chuan thil sâwt lo a ûm a, Nilêng lêngin khawchhak lam lalte tlawnin a buai; Dâwt sawi a hrât a, tharum thawh a uar, Asuria nên thu an thlung a, Aigupta-ah hriak a thawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Juda-ho chungah vuina a nei. Jakoba chu a awm dân sual avângin a hrem ang a, A thil tih ang zêlin a thungrûl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chhûla a awm laiin a unau keartuiah a man a, A vânglaiin Pathian a buan a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vântirhkoh chu a bei a, a hneh ta a, Malsâwmna dîlin a ṭap a, Bethel-ah Pathian a hmu a, Ani chuan thu a lo hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A ni, Lalpa , Engkim Pathian chu a hming Lalpa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuvângin, i Pathian hnênah kîr leh la, Khawngaihna leh dikna ngaina la, I Pathianah chuan innghat rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sumdâwngten bûkna dik lo an hmang a, Bum an chîng êm êm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Efraim chuan chapo takin, ‘Ka hausa a, sum leh pai ka ngah a, Eng mah tihsual ka nei lo,’ a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei hi Lalpa , i Pathian, Aigupta ram aṭanga hruai chhuaktu che ka ni. Thlalêra in hnêna ka lo kal lai ang khân, Puan inahte ka chêntîr leh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zâwlnei hmangin thu ka sawi a, Inlârna tam tak ka hmuhtîr a, Tehkhin thuin anni chu ka zirtîr ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Gilead chu a bawhchhiatna avângin Eng mah a ni ta lo, Gilgal-ah pawh bâwng lem an bia a, An maichâmte chu leilet zâwla Lung paih khâwm ang mai a la ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jakoba chu Aram bialah a tlânchhia a, Israelan nupui man a tuak a, Berâm vênah nupui a hlawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Aigupta aṭanga a mi Israel chu zâwlnei hmangin a hruai chhuak a, Anni chu zâwlnei hmangin a enkawl ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mahse, Efraim chuan a tithinur nasa êm êm a, Chuvângin, an thisen chhuah mawh chu an phur ang, Lalpa an timualpho va, an mualpho ve ngei ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Efraim a han ṭawng chuan Israel hnam dangte an khûr a, An zîngah ngaihsân a ni ṭhîn. Baal biaa a sual tâk avângin a chhe ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tûnah pawh hian an sual zual deuh deuh va, Tangkaraw milimte an chhûng a, Chûng milimte chu an duh dân ang taka Kut themthiamte siam a ni. Mihringa inthawite chuan Bâwngno limte lam pawh ‘Fawh tûr,’ an ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuvângin, zîng ṭiauchhûm ang te, Dai tla ral leh thuai ṭhîn ang te, Hruihzâwla buhsi thli len bo ang te, Tukverha meikhu chhuak ang te an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kei hi Lalpa in Pathian, Aigupta ram ata hruaichhuaktu che u ka ni, Keimah lo chu Pathian dang in hre lo va, Chhandamtu dang in neih hek loh kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thlalêr ram rovahte khân ka kaihruai che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Anni chu tlai takin ka hrai a, An puar hnu chuan an chapo va, Min theihnghilh ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An tân sakeibaknei ang ka ni ang a, Keite angin anni chu kawngah ka lo châng ru ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A note lâksak savawm thinur angin An lung tuamtu ka haithlêr ang a, Sakeibaknei angin an sa ka ei ang a, Ram sakawlhte angin ka pawt sawm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel, nangmah ṭanpuitu mi do hi I chhiat phah dâwn a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lal leh hotu in dîlte kha In khawpuite chhan tûrin khawnge an awm tâk?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thinur chungin lal ka pe che u a, Ka thin a rim vângin anni chu ka la bo leh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Efraim khawlohna chu ziak vek a ni a, An suahsualnate pawh chhinchhiah vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nau vei angin a na thut ang a, Mahse, pian huna chhuah nachâng hre lo nau ang hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Seol thiltihtheihna ata chhanchhuakin, Thihna lak ata ka tlan dâwn em ni? Aw thihna, khawnge i hri chhia chu? Aw Seol, khawnge i tihchhiat theihna chu? Khawngaihna mitin ka en dâwn tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A unaute zîngah lo hmuingîl mahse, Lalpa thlî, khawchhak lam aṭangin a lo tleh ang a, Thlalêr aṭangin a rawn nuai ang. Luikawrte pawh a châr vek ang. A ro khâwl khâwm zawng zawng pawh an lâksak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian laka a hel avângin Samaria chuan a sual man a têl ang, Khandaiha thah an ni ang a, Nausênte chu lei vuak nân an hmansak ang a, Nau pai laite pum chu an taithlêr ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Israel, i Pathian, Lalpa hnênah kîr leh rawh, I bawhchhiatna avângin i tlûk tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa hnênah kîr leh ula, Hetiang hian thupha chawi rawh u: “Kan bawhchhiatna zawng zawng la bo la, Kan tihṭhatte lo lâwm ang che. Tichuan, fakna inthawina kan hlân ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Asuria chuan min chhan thei lo va, Indona sakawr chuan min hum thei bawk hek lo. Kan kutchhuakte hnênah, ‘Kan Pathian in ni,’ Kan ti tawh ngai lo vang. I hnên aṭang hian a ni fahrahten khawngaihna an dawn ṭhîn ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An rinawm lohna chu ka tihdamsak ang a, Anni chu ka hmangaih hrim hrim dâwn a ni, An chunga ka thinurna pawh a reh tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel tân daifîm ang ka ni ang a, Lili angin a lo pâr vul ang. Lebanon tlâng thing angin nghet takin zung a kai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A zârte chu a ṭawi luai ang a, Oliv thing anga mawi a ni ang, Lebanon angin a rim a tui bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka hlimah an lo chêng leh ang a, Thlai angin an duah hluah hluah ang. Grep angin an rah tuar ang a, Lebanon uain angin an hming a thang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Efraim chuan milem nên inzawmna rêng a nei tawh lo vang a, Keiin ka lo ngaihsak ang a, Ka kaihruai ang. Kei hi fâr thing anga zâr hliahtu chu ka ni, Kei hi malsâwm tinrêng hnâr chu ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tu nge finga hêng hi hrethiam ang le? Tu nge hrethiama ngaihtuah chhuak thei le? Lalpa kawngte chu a ngîl a, Mi dikte chuan an zawh ṭhîn. Mi sualte erawh chuan an zawh lo va, An tlu thîn.
  </para>
</usx>
